WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.590
Chris Gore, Founder/Owner of FilmThreat/Author/Filmmaker:
Let's say we're going to reboot the franchise

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:02.590
Back To The Future.

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:06.890
Let's just think about how we would do that
